# Keep LF line endings on these files even when cloned on Windows. The self-play arena
# (tools/selfplay_arena.js) extracts the MCTS planner out of src/web/index.html with a regex that
# anchors on LF newlines; a CRLF checkout makes that extraction silently fail, so the training
# tools must see LF regardless of the client's core.autocrlf setting.
*.js   text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
